    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>For a given Sv (overburden stress at the model top), this visitor computes:</para>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>the (hydraulic) &apos;conductivity&apos; from the element &apos;permeability&apos; and (nodal) &apos;fluid viscosity&apos;</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>(nodal) &apos;gravity force&apos; scalar variable as the product of g (specified by user) and the &apos;dry rock density&apos; specified as element property.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>the (element) &apos;gravity term&apos; vector variable used in for the integration of the fluid density via the corresponding PDE operator.</para>
<para><xrefsect id="todo_1_todo000222"><xreftitle>Todo</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>SKM: this visitor should include the influence of pore pressure.</para>
</xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
